{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02751","headline":"中和乐九章 歌诸王第七 · 卢照邻","name":"中和乐九章 歌诸王第七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"星陈帝子，岳列天孙。\n义光带砺，象着乾坤。\n我有明德，利建攸存。\n苴以茅社，锡以牺尊。\n藩屏王室，翼亮尧门。\n八才两献，夫何足论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02751.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02751","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}